PART 1 — CREATE CUSTOM OBJECT

This creates your database table.

Step 1: Open Setup

Top-right:
⚙️ Gear Icon → Setup

Step 2: Go to Object Manager

Top bar:

Object Manager

Click it.

Step 3: Create Custom Object

Click:

Create → Custom Object
Fill Details
Field	Value
Label	Student
Plural Label	Students
Record Name	Student Name
Data Type	Text
Important Checkbox

✅ Check:

Launch New Custom Tab Wizard after saving this custom object

Then click:

Save
What happened?

Salesforce created:

Student database table
internal API name
storage structure

Equivalent to SQL table creation.

