PART 3 — CREATE TAB

This gives visible navigation in Salesforce.

If Tab Wizard Opened Automatically

Choose:

Student

Select any icon/color.

Next → Next → Save

Done.

If Not Opened

Go to:

Setup → Tabs

Then:

Custom Object Tabs → New

Choose:

Student

Save.

PART 4 — CREATE LIGHTNING APP

Now we make the full app.

Step 1: App Manager

Go:

Setup → App Manager

Click:

New Lightning App
Step 2: App Details
Field	Value
App Name	Student Management System

Click:

Next
Step 3: Branding

Optional:

logo
color

Skip if needed.

Next.

Step 4: Navigation Items

Add:

Students
Reports
Dashboards

Move them to Selected Items.

Next.

Step 5: User Profiles

Select:

System Administrator

Save & Finish.

PART 5 — OPEN YOUR APP

